From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Li Guan <guanli.oerv@isrc.iscas.ac.cn>
Date: Sun, 20 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] build: allow setuptools-scm 10

openRuyi provides setuptools-scm 10.0.5.  Stone's generated version file and
setuptools-scm configuration work with that release, so retain the minimum
version while removing the obsolete build-only upper bound.

Signed-off-by: Li Guan <guanli.oerv@isrc.iscas.ac.cn>
---
 pyproject.toml | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/pyproject.toml b/pyproject.toml
index aff7608..85b7399 100644
--- a/pyproject.toml
+++ b/pyproject.toml
@@ -5,3 +5,3 @@
 # and writes it to stone/_version.py for runtime access.
-requires = ["setuptools>=77", "setuptools-scm>=8,<9"]
+requires = ["setuptools>=77", "setuptools-scm>=8"]
 build-backend = "setuptools.build_meta"
